# MCP Server — Setup
File: mcp/docs/MCP_SETUP.oot

The openOODA MCP server speaks protocol `2024-11-05`. Stdio is a live frame loop. `--file` is one-shot. JSON-RPC in, capability-gated dispatch, Content-Length bytes out.

Version is the git tag. There is no VERSION file.

## Launch

```sh
OODACODEX=/path/to/openOODA/NORTHSTAR.oot ooda mcp
ooda mcp --stdio
ooda mcp --file path/to/request.json
ooda mcp-merge ~/.config/openooda/agent-config.json
```

`--socket` is not a transport. A file read is not a socket.

OODACODEX is required. Missing or unreadable codex fails closed.

mcp-merge exit codes: 0 already present, 1 written, 2 error.

## Environment

| Name | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| OODACODEX | Path to the orientation text. Required. |
| OODA_COMPILER | Compiler binary for oodac_check/emit/build. Else OODAC_BIN. Unset fails those tools closed; governance tools unaffected. |
| OODA_FS_READDIR | Jail root for server reads and compiler resolution. |
| OODA_FS_WRITEDIR | Jail root for build temp files and merge writes. |

Board reads join `dirname(OODACODEX)` with the relative board path. If the file is absent, the tool returns cannot-read.

## Transports

1. stdio (default). Live frame loop. Content-Length bytes. Raw JSON object or array accepted. Idle hangup 5 minutes. 256 frames and 1MiB fail closed.
2. file. Bounded buffer of frames. Same caps. Then exit.

## Methods

initialize, notifications/initialized, tools/list, tools/call, resources/list, resources/read, prompts/list, prompts/get, ping, shutdown, exit, roots/list, notifications/cancelled, notifications/roots/list_changed.

sampling/createMessage is not offered. Unknown methods return -32601.

## See also

protocol.oot, client_config.oot, TOOLS.oot.
